  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 682767581184
    m_Localized: Use the Spacebar to jump. Jumping allows you to temporarily lift
      the character off the platform to overcome obstacles in the path, without altering
      the logic level of the line being drawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698110345216
    m_Localized: Press the Shift key to dash. This action allows you to quickly boost
      the character's movement, providing agility and making it easier to overcome
      obstacles in the level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 650081370112
    m_Localized: "Use the A and D keys (or \u2190 and \u2192 arrows) to control the
      character. Moving right represents the passage of time in the diagram's context,
      gradually drawing the output line according to the path taken. Moving left
      represents rewinding time, allowing you to erase the drawn output line to correct
      any errors in the diagram."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
